> > 24.193 etcd1           {"msg":"Range: client request started","client-request-id":7179191402480470876}
> 
> Theoretically, seeing a log first does not necessarily mean the event actually happened first although in practice this is true most of the time, because it's not only async, but also in different processes.

The time here comes from Antithesis simulation. @participant2 I think we can trust the time and order on Antithesis logs, right?

